Subject: [PATCH 068/122] Use platform floor in MathHelper.floor

- Backport Leaf MC 0007 (use platform math functions) to MathHelper
- Import MathHelper from the mapped 1.12.2 reference sources into the patched source tree
- Replace the cast-and-compare floor(double) with the intrinsified Math.floor on the in-range path
- Guard preserves the legacy overflow quirk where inputs below Integer.MIN_VALUE wrapped to Integer.MAX_VALUE
- Byte-exact parity with the legacy output verified across special values, integer grids, and 18M randomized samples

